regprof - register a public profile

usage: regprof

    Text other users can see with profile / readprof / searchprof.
    The real name and address on the private member card are not shown.
    The current public text opens as-is; move with the arrows to edit.
    Submit with "." on its own line; empty then "." deletes; Ctrl-C aborts.
    Up to 16 lines, 78 characters per line.
